OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers persisting this evening before
OL,7,Fa band of more organised rain arrives
OL,8,Flater and into the night. Heavy in
OL,9,Fplaces with gusty winds, particularly
OL,10,Falong southern coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain throughout. Some
OL,14,Fisolated sunny spells and drier in the
OL,15,Fnorth. Light winds and temperatures
OL,16,Fclose to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
